DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbccee provides support for the Broadcom BCM4401 10/100 Ethernet card.

     The following media types and options (as given to ifconfig(8)) are sup‐
     ported:

           mmeeddiiaa autoselect
                Enable autoselection of the media type and options (default).

           mmeeddiiaa 100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation and force full-duplex
                mode.

           mmeeddiiaa 100baseTX mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation and force half-duplex
                mode.

           mmeeddiiaa 10baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt full-duplex
                Set 10Mbps operation and force full-duplex.

           mmeeddiiaa 10baseT mmeeddiiaaoopptt half-duplex
                Set 10Mbps operation and force half-duplex.

     If no media options are present, the bbccee driver places the card into au‐
     toselect mode.

